PNG → SVG → Robot Drawing

You do NOT use the PNG directly in the robot code.

Step 1 — Open PNG in Inkscape
File → Open
Select your PNG
Step 2 — Convert PNG to Vector

In Inkscape:

Path → Trace Bitmap

Single Scan
Brightness Cutoff
Check “Preview”
Apply

Step 3 — Delete the Original PNG Layer

After tracing:

move the vector slightly

original PNG
traced vector

Delete the original PNG.

Keep ONLY the vector.

Step 4 — Save as Plain SVG
File → Save As → Plain SVG

Save it as:

output.svg

Keep:

SVG_FILE = "output.svg"

and run the script.

